WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:03.682
(crickets chirping)

00:00:03.682 --> 00:00:06.775
(passionate moaning)

00:00:06.775 --> 00:00:07.608
- Oh.

00:00:09.925 --> 00:00:13.863
Ugh.
(passionate moaning)

00:00:13.863 --> 00:00:14.821
(soft music)

00:00:14.821 --> 00:00:16.138
(knocking)

00:00:16.138 --> 00:00:18.341
- [Mom] Time to get up, darling.

00:00:18.341 --> 00:00:19.341
- Okay, Mum.

00:00:24.252 --> 00:00:25.752
Oh shit, I'm late.

00:00:26.886 --> 00:00:29.826
Mum, have you seen my blue shirt?

00:00:29.826 --> 00:00:31.914
- [Mum] It's in the laundry room, darling.

00:00:31.914 --> 00:00:33.282
- Oh, thank you.

00:00:33.282 --> 00:00:34.264
Mum, I can't find my blue shirt.

00:00:34.264 --> 00:00:36.619
I miss you so much and
everything's horrible.

00:00:36.619 --> 00:00:38.288
- Girls, are you ready to go?

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:40.689
- Yes definitely, I just
wanna get a selfie first.

00:00:40.689 --> 00:00:42.380
(soft music)

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.014
Yay, that's cute.

00:00:44.014 --> 00:00:46.681
- [Group] Yeah, I like that one.

00:00:51.902 --> 00:00:53.374
(sighs)

00:00:53.374 --> 00:00:54.521
Yeah, I'm just gonna pop to Tesco,

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:56.971
then probably get a coffee at Costa

00:00:56.971 --> 00:00:59.041
and then I'll meet you at Tricia's.

00:00:59.041 --> 00:01:00.946
(sighs)

00:01:00.946 --> 00:01:02.923
Where's room C?

00:01:02.923 --> 00:01:05.227
Excuse me, is this room C?

00:01:05.227 --> 00:01:06.060
No, okay.

00:01:11.686 --> 00:01:12.642
I give up.

00:01:12.642 --> 00:01:13.619
- Is he from...?

00:01:13.619 --> 00:01:14.452
- Popcorn.

00:01:14.452 --> 00:01:15.285
(yells)

00:01:15.285 --> 00:01:16.296
(laughs)

00:01:16.296 --> 00:01:17.129
- Oi, shut up.

00:01:17.129 --> 00:01:19.103
- No, I just wanna know.

00:01:19.103 --> 00:01:19.936
- Do you know?

00:01:19.936 --> 00:01:21.478
- No I don't know,
that's why I'm watching.

00:01:21.478 --> 00:01:22.728
- No one knows.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.517
(soft music)

00:01:29.514 --> 00:01:31.752
- Thank you, Mum!

00:01:31.752 --> 00:01:32.752
Looks great.

00:01:41.443 --> 00:01:42.625
(laughs)

00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:43.458
Yes.

00:01:53.497 --> 00:01:55.497
(sighs)

00:02:02.975 --> 00:02:05.558
(upbeat music)

